Package: snapshot-wiki
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, firefox-esr | www-browser, sensible-utils
Description: SnapshOT Wiki: offline tool and lifecycle documentation
 A static site, built with MkDocs Material at package build time and installed
 to /usr/share/snapshot/wiki, documenting every SnapshOT tool against the OT
 incident-response lifecycle (SANS PICERL, NIST CSF 2.0, MITRE ATT&CK for ICS).
 It opens from file:// with no network: search, tags and the interactive graphs
 work offline.
 .
 The package also makes Firefox ESR the quiet default browser: an enterprise
 policy and system preferences that stop it making unsolicited connections, and
 the Xfce and XDG default-browser settings (diverting xfce4-helpers'
 /etc/xdg/xfce4/helpers.rc).
